# PLACEHOLDER scenes of the test chapter (chapters/test.ron, ticket 0801),
# which New Game plays until Chapter 1 exists (0803). The intro uses the
# lead's name and pronoun tokens.

@scene test_intro
@caption Test Field, morning
@left  lead neutral
@right test_knight neutral
test_knight: {lead}! The fort is just ahead.
> {lead} looks over the field. {They} can see the fort from here.
test_knight: Take it before the brigand does.
@end

@scene test_victory
@left  lead happy
@right test_knight happy
test_knight: The fort is ours, {lead}. Well done.
@end
